<div class="post-entry-content">

	<h3 class="entry-title">
		<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/http://labour.gov.ng/2025/02/06/labour-permanent-secretary-assumes-office-harps-on-patriotism/" title="LABOUR PERMANENT SECRETARY ASSUMES OFFICE, HARPS ON PATRIOTISM" rel="bookmark">LABOUR PERMANENT SECRETARY ASSUMES OFFICE, HARPS ON PATRIOTISM</a>
	</h3>

	<div class="entry-meta"><span class="category-link"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/http://labour.gov.ng/category/press-release/">Press Release</a></span></div>
	<div class="entry-excerpt"><p>The newly appointed Permanent Secretary for Labour and Employment, Dr. Salihu A. Usman has emphasised the importance of patriotism in driving better service delivery. Usman, who spoke in Abuja as he assumed duties in the Ministry today, said that public officials must be patriotic to effectively discharge their duties. He also stressed that dedication, sincerity&hellip;</p>
