ral Secretariat Complex Phase I, Annex II, Shehu Shagari Way, Abuja FCT. Nigeria</li><li><span class="color-primary">Phone number:</span><br/>+(234) 805 138 3688</li><li><span class="color-primary">E-mail:</span><br/>info@labour.gov.ng</li></ul><div class="soc-ico"><p class="assistive-text">Find us on:</p><a title="Facebook page opens in new window" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/https://web.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100075708924259" target="_blank" class="facebook"><span class="soc-font-icon"></span><span class="screen-reader-text">Facebook page opens in new window</span></a><a title="X page opens in new window" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/https://x.com/LabourMinNG" target="_blank" class="twitter"><span class="soc-font-icon"></span><span class="screen-reader-text">X page opens in new window</span></a><a title="Mail page opens in new window" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/mailto:info@labour.gov.ng" target="_top" class="mail"><span class="soc-font-icon"></span><span class="screen-reader-text">Mail page opens in new window</span></a><a title="Website page opens in new window" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20250327031231/https://labour.gov.ng/" target="_blank" class="website"><span class="soc-font-icon"></span><span class="screen-reader-text">Website page opens in new window</span></a></div></section>					</div><!-- .wf-container -->
